## Technical Stack & Architecture
- **Frontend**: React 19, TypeScript, Vite, Tailwind CSS, Lucide Icons, Canvas Confetti.
- **Backend**: Express on Node.js with Gemini 2.5 Flash (`@google/genai`).
- **State Management**: Reactive local state with LocalStorage persistence and automated quantity synchronizer.
- **Execution Port**: 3000
